WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.166 --> 00:00:00.750
Hey, everyone!

2
00:00:00.750 --> 00:00:03.251
I'm Chase, head of a support
team here at Basecamp.

3
00:00:03.251 --> 00:00:06.919
When you talk to our team, you're
talking to a real person just like me.

4
00:00:06.961 --> 00:00:08.587
I've been here for 15 years now,

5
00:00:08.587 --> 00:00:12.505
and each person on a team
has about a decade's worth of experience.

6
00:00:12.588 --> 00:00:14.881
Best of all, we're all over the world.

7
00:00:14.881 --> 00:00:17.299
So when you're working, we're here.

8
00:00:17.299 --> 00:00:19.341
If you've got a question for us,

9
00:00:19.341 --> 00:00:20.008
email us

10
00:00:21.717 --> 00:00:23.593
If you want to talk to me directly

11
00:00:25.552 --> 00:00:27.303
We're here ready to help.

12
00:00:27.303 --> 00:00:28.678
Look forward to talking to you.
